---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /dashboard/
title: Dashboard
lang: de
description: "Dashboard mit Statistiken zum Stand des letzten Builds: veröffentlichte und geplante Geschichten."
---
<h1>Dashboard — Statistik (Build-Zeit / Statystyki czasu budowania)</h1>
<p>Diese Seite wird bei jedem Build neu erzeugt. Zahlen unten sind der Stand zum Zeitpunkt des letzten Builds — kein Live-Tracking.</p>

<table class="stats">
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Sprache / Język</th><th>Veröffentlichte Geschichten</th><th>Geplante Geschichten (Datum in der Zukunft)</th><th>Neueste Geschichte</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>Deutsch (DE)</td>
      <td>{{ collections.posts_de | length }}</td>
      <td>{{ collections.scheduled_de | length }}</td>
      <td>
        {% if collections.posts_de | length %}
          {% set latest = collections.posts_de[0] %}
          <a href="{{ latest.url }}">{{ latest.data.title }}</a> — {{ latest.date | dateLocalized('de-DE') }}
        {% else %}—{% endif %}
      </td>
    </tr>
    {# Hang PL chi hien khi khong build loc tieng Duc (Phuong an A, Ruler 15:52 27/11). #}
    {% if build_lang != "de" %}
    <tr>
      <td>Polski (PL)</td>
      <td>{{ collections.posts_pl | length }}</td>
      <td>{{ collections.scheduled_pl | length }}</td>
      <td>
        {% if collections.posts_pl | length %}
          {% set latest = collections.posts_pl[0] %}
          <a href="{{ latest.url }}">{{ latest.data.title }}</a> — {{ latest.date | dateLocalized('pl-PL') }}
        {% else %}—{% endif %}
      </td>
    </tr>
    {% endif %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>Besucherstatistik (GoatCounter)</h2>
<p>
  {% if settings.goatcounter_domain_de and '[GIỮ CHỖ' not in settings.goatcounter_domain_de %}
    <a href="https://{{ settings.goatcounter_domain_de }}/">GoatCounter-Statistik (DE) öffnen</a><br>
  {% endif %}
  {% if build_lang != "de" %}
  {% if settings.goatcounter_domain_pl and '[GIỮ CHỖ' not in settings.goatcounter_domain_pl %}
    <a href="https://{{ settings.goatcounter_domain_pl }}/">GoatCounter-Statistik (PL) öffnen</a>
  {% endif %}
  {% endif %}
</p>

<h2>Geplante Geschichten (Details)</h2>
<ul>
{% for post in collections.scheduled_de %}
  <li>DE: {{ post.data.title }} — {{ post.date | dateLocalized('de-DE') }}</li>
{% endfor %}
{% if build_lang != "de" %}
{% for post in collections.scheduled_pl %}
  <li>PL: {{ post.data.title }} — {{ post.date | dateLocalized('pl-PL') }}</li>
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if collections.scheduled_de.length == 0 and collections.scheduled_pl.length == 0 %}
  <li>Keine geplanten Geschichten.{% if build_lang != "de" %} / Brak zaplanowanych opowieści.{% endif %}</li>
{% endif %}
</ul>
